@startuml
left to right direction

actor "Visitor" as user
component "cvbot-retriever\n(FastAPI + RAG)" as retriever
component "cvbot-embedder\n(ingestion pipeline)" as embedder
component "cvbot-infra\n(Terraform infra)" as infra
component "Markdown CV\ndocuments" as docs
database "ChromaDB\n(ECS Fargate)" as chroma
component "cvbot-core\n(shared library)" as core
cloud "AWS Bedrock\n(embeddings + LLM)" as bedrock

docs --> embedder : load & chunk
embedder --> chroma : write chunks\n+ schema
chroma --> retriever : read chunks\n+ filters
user --> retriever : questions
embedder ..> bedrock
retriever ..> bedrock
infra ..> bedrock : provides
infra ..> chroma : provides
infra ..> docs : hosts
core ..> embedder : pinned dependency
core ..> retriever : pinned dependency
@enduml
